Paperless-ngx is API-token based, so like Nextcloud and Immich there is nothing
for an admin to register. The one thing worth saying up front is that a save
lands asynchronously, because an admin who tests the integration will otherwise
watch the document fail to appear and conclude the connection is broken.
#}
